<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - News Corp cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - News Corp cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney downgraded News Corp Ltd to neutral from buy, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
